OL,3,CProgramme listings for WED 7 JAN
OL,4,G0930FEssential Classics
OL,5,     GIan Skelly plays the best in
OL,6,     Gclassical music, with discoveries
OL,7,     Gand surprises rubbing shoulders
OL,8,     Gwith familiar favourites.
OL,9,G1300FClassical Live
OL,10,     GAlfred Brendel plays Beethoven's
OL,11,     GPiano Concerto No.3 in an archive
OL,12,     Grecording with the Bavarian Radio
OL,13,     GSymphony Orchestra, plus pianist
OL,14,     GJaedan Isik-Dzurko with a
OL,15,     Gmasterpiece by Bach.
OL,16,G1500FChoral Evensong
OL,17,     GAn Epiphany Carol Service from St
OL,18,     GLuke's, Chelsea, London, with
OL,19,     Gmusic by Sheppard, Clemens,
OL,20,     GCrotch, Morten Lauridsen, Philip
OL,21,     GStopford, John Rutter and
OL,22,     GBruckner.
